<title>USA: Simon DeBartolo files $1 bln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Simon DeBartolo files $1 bln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Simon DeBartolo Group filed Wednesday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $1 billion in debt securities.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used for general corporate purposes, which may include repaying outsdtanding debt and funding future acquisitions, the Indianapolis based real estate company said.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
</text>
